 "about": "One table for the three validators of a GitHub link that may open from the panel: nagi_links.github_link (tests/test_github_links.py), safeGithub in web/glance-ci.js (tests/glance-ci.test.cjs) and SourceLinks.githubLink (mac/Tests/NagiCoreTests/GitHubLinkTests.swift). Every accepted link is returned unchanged; every refused one is None, null or nil. Each validator must also refuse every name in reserved as a first segment, in any case. One difference is deliberate and tested on its own: safeGithub first turns the reader's https://github.com/o/r/actions?query=branch%3A<name> into https://github.com/o/r/actions, so that link is not in this table.",
